This repository orchestrates and builds on a number of independent third-party
components, each distributed under its own license. The MIT license above
applies to this repository's own source (the Docker Compose stack,
configuration files, and the Python services under orthanc/). It does NOT
relicense the bundled or pulled components, which retain their original terms.
See the "License" section of README.md for a summary of those components and
their licenses (notably: Orthanc — GPLv3; Grafana — AGPLv3; the MST model
weights — CC-BY-NC-4.0; and Google MedGemma — Health AI Developer Foundation
terms). Because several of these are non-commercial or copyleft, the assembled
platform is intended for research use only.
